# Reference only. The app reads its environment from the .env at the REPOSITORY
# ROOT, not from this directory, so there is one file to edit rather than two.
#
# These are the variables this app actually consumes:
#
#   VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID        wallet connection, required
#   VITE_RPC_MAINNET             chain reads
#   VITE_RPC_FALLBACKS           comma separated, tried in order
#   VITE_RPC_LOGS                endpoint permitted to serve wide eth_getLogs
#   VITE_LOG_CHUNK               blocks per getLogs request
#   VITE_LOG_RANGE               how far back to look
#   VITE_INDEXER_URL             the indexer, once it is running
#   VITE_PUNS_PASS_ADDRESS
#   VITE_LAUNCH_FACTORY_ADDRESS
#   VITE_LAUNCH_AND_BUY_ADDRESS
#   VITE_IPFS_GATEWAY
#   VITE_EXPLORER_URL
#
#   PINATA_JWT                   server side only, never exposed to the browser
